rm relationship with the EU and that Brexit had done =E2=80=9Cmore harm tha=
n good=E2=80=9D to the country. He would also like to reform the voting sys=
tem so that =E2=80=9Ceveryone=E2=80=99s vote counts and everyone=E2=80=99s =
voice is heard=E2=80=9D.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18p=
